    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302-a3">

                <pb facs="0429" n="409" xml:id="pg409"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 3]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Text of Message From Prime Minister of India to
                        Marshal Stalin</hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d302-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>I am most grateful for Your Excellency’s prompt and encouraging response. I am
                    communicating immediately with the other governments concerned and hope to be
                    able to approach Your Excellency again soon.</p>
                <p>With respects,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jawaharlal Nehru</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d302-f1" n="3" type="source" xml:id="d302-f1-content">
                <p>Communicated to the Soviet Government on July 16, in response to Generalissimo
                    Stalin’s message printed in Enclosure 2, above.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
